{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Text Escape: Doomsday City&quot;, you play as an office worker witnessing the catastrophic outbreak on your way home from work. After the disaster, you've been hiding in your home for a week. However, the fragile peace of your refuge is shattered when zombies break into your backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses minimalist blocks to depict scenes, conveying information through text and color. Your task is to control the mouse and experiment with different interactions\u2014clicking, dragging, long-pressing\u2014to solve the puzzles in each level. The settings range from your own home to outdoor parks, and then to urban buildings like banks and construction sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into 14 levels. While the puzzles and gameplay of each level are self-contained, they are woven together by the protagonist's survival story. Use your wits to help the protagonist escape this doomed city!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bedroom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4132080/4da453bb4f43e321a810ef2fcd8a3bc66e71326b.jpg"},{"name":"Backyard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4132080/97c175239c72c5387d078a7427dab9848cd16eae.jpg"},{"name":"Kitchen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4132080/1d84b5bf7743dff56ebda000732c00c9cb36d20e.jpg"},{"name":"Living Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4132080/4ff20276fefaa352bb1379b6739f1b7073c3b8cd.jpg"},{"name":"Villa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4132080/0d5a6f59d650f4f03da6e8d3fd7647303c7d26c3.jpg"},{"name":"Oasis Camp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4132080/e7ac0daf5927934a3ea9a0a283413c6e0bb17903.jpg"